OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest as man
OL,4,Afound badly burnt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after a
OL,8,Fman was hospitalised with
OL,9,Flife-threatening burn injuries.
OL,11,FSouth Yorkshire Police were called to
OL,12,Freports of an injured man on Warmsworth
OL,13,FRoad in Doncaster at 23:35 BST on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FHe was taken to hospital by the
OL,17,Fambulance service where he remains in a
OL,18,Fserious condition.
